WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.805 --> 00:00:10.561
Matt's family just moved to a new town. He needs to go to a new school.

2
00:00:10.562 --> 00:00:13.165
He is also going to need to make new friends.

3
00:00:13.166 --> 00:00:16.154
But it's not easy to make new friends in a new school.

4
00:00:16.155 --> 00:00:20.464
"This is Matt. I'm sure you'll make him feel welcome."

5
00:00:20.465 --> 00:00:23.193
Mrs. Emory introduced him to the class.

6
00:00:23.194 --> 00:00:26.240
Matt sat next to a girl named Georgia.

7
00:00:26.241 --> 00:00:29.090
"Hi, I'm Georgia!" she said.

8
00:00:29.091 --> 00:00:33.818
Matt pretended to tie his shoelace. He was too shy to talk to Georgia.

9
00:00:33.819 --> 00:00:36.507
Matt's first day of school wasn't too bad.

10
00:00:36.508 --> 00:00:38.939
At least no one else tried to talk to him.

11
00:00:38.940 --> 00:00:42.354
"You're the new kid, right?" asked Jeff after school.

12
00:00:42.355 --> 00:00:47.037
"Do you want to play basketball with us?" asked a boy named Spike.

13
00:00:47.038 --> 00:00:48.633
Matt shook his head.

14
00:00:48.634 --> 00:00:51.784
"Okay, see you tomorrow!" said Jeff.

15
00:00:51.785 --> 00:00:55.194
"Okay, see you tomorrow!" said Spike.

16
00:00:55.195 --> 00:00:57.439
Matt was feeling angry with himself.

17
00:00:57.440 --> 00:01:02.113
"Why didn't I say something?" he said aloud.

18
00:01:02.114 --> 00:01:05.158
"They probably think I'm stupid!"

19
00:01:05.159 --> 00:01:08.413
Matt wasn't stupid. He was just very shy.

20
00:01:08.414 --> 00:01:12.567
At his old school, it took Matt almost a year to make friends.

21
00:01:12.568 --> 00:01:15.122
He never felt comfortable speaking to people.

22
00:01:15.123 --> 00:01:17.665
Matt wished he could live on a deserted island.

23
00:01:17.666 --> 00:01:20.803
That way he would never have to say anything to anyone.

24
00:01:20.804 --> 00:01:23.744
After school, Matt watched the soccer team practicing.

25
00:01:23.745 --> 00:01:26.376
Matt's new school had a very good soccer team.

26
00:01:26.377 --> 00:01:29.577
In fact, they were one of the top teams in the league.

27
00:01:29.578 --> 00:01:33.882
"But Coach, I'll be better soon!" moaned Ben.

28
00:01:33.883 --> 00:01:38.561
Ben was the team's midfielder. He had broken his leg during the last match.

29
00:01:38.562 --> 00:01:42.647
"Are you new here? I'm Coach Klein," a voice called out.

30
00:01:42.648 --> 00:01:46.194
"Hi, I'm Ben!" the boy with crutches said to Matt.

31
00:01:46.195 --> 00:01:48.707
"Immad," Matt mumbled.

32
00:01:48.708 --> 00:01:51.008
"What?" asked Ben.

33
00:01:51.009 --> 00:01:54.490
"I'm Matt," he said more clearly this time.

34
00:01:54.491 --> 00:01:58.496
"Matt, have you ever played soccer before?" Coach Klein asked.

35
00:01:58.497 --> 00:02:01.341
Matt answered, "Well, sort of."

36
00:02:01.342 --> 00:02:04.694
Matt used to play soccer with his friends from his old neighborhood.

37
00:02:04.695 --> 00:02:06.841
But he had never played on a team before.

38
00:02:06.842 --> 00:02:09.909
Ben promised to help Matt become a good midfielder.

39
00:02:09.910 --> 00:02:14.646
"I don't know if I can do it," Matt said in a low voice.

40
00:02:14.647 --> 00:02:19.845
"What? I can't hear a word you're saying!" Ben said loudly.

41
00:02:19.846 --> 00:02:23.310
Every day after school, Matt practiced with the team.

42
00:02:23.311 --> 00:02:25.917
Matt tried his best to be a good midfielder.

43
00:02:25.918 --> 00:02:29.250
He ran to head the ball but collided with Victor.

44
00:02:29.251 --> 00:02:32.821
"You're supposed to call it!" shouted Victor.

45
00:02:32.822 --> 00:02:37.648
"Matt! When you're going for the ball, you must let your teammates know!"

46
00:02:37.649 --> 00:02:39.576
Coach Klein told him.

47
00:02:39.577 --> 00:02:43.304
"Sorry," mumbled Matt.

48
00:02:43.305 --> 00:02:46.405
The coach was worried about Matt.

49
00:02:46.406 --> 00:02:52.262
"I don't think it's going to work with Matt," Coach Klein said to Ben.

50
00:02:52.263 --> 00:02:54.587
"We need to find someone else."

51
00:02:54.588 --> 00:02:58.213
"Coach Klein, please give Matt another chance.

52
00:02:58.214 --> 00:03:02.768
Look at how he moves!" Ben pleaded.

53
00:03:02.769 --> 00:03:05.872
"Matt just needs to learn about teamwork.

54
00:03:05.873 --> 00:03:10.108
I'll help him!" Ben said.

55
00:03:10.109 --> 00:03:13.512
"Soccer is about teamwork," Ben explained.

56
00:03:13.513 --> 00:03:17.018
"Everyone is like a different instrument in an orchestra.

57
00:03:17.019 --> 00:03:20.510
We need to play together in harmony.

58
00:03:20.511 --> 00:03:23.640
You have to show that you are part of the team!"

59
00:03:23.641 --> 00:03:31.640
"Luke!" Matt called out and kicked the ball to him.

60
00:03:31.641 --> 00:03:34.658
At Matt's first match, he was very nervous.

61
00:03:34.659 --> 00:03:40.881
Matt tried to concentrate on what Ben had said about teamwork.

62
00:03:40.882 --> 00:03:43.179
Matt noticed that Victor needed help.

63
00:03:43.180 --> 00:03:53.272
Matt opened his mouth to speak, but no sounds came out.

64
00:03:53.273 --> 00:03:56.136
Matt's team lost one to zero.

65
00:03:56.137 --> 00:04:00.724
"It's all my fault," Matt thought to himself after the game.

66
00:04:00.725 --> 00:04:04.673
"Hey, you played well today," Victor said as he came up to Matt.

67
00:04:04.674 --> 00:04:10.391
"It was your first match. Next time you'll do better."

68
00:04:10.392 --> 00:04:13.749
Matt's team was not angry with him for losing the game.

69
00:04:13.750 --> 00:04:17.370
"Teamwork! Orchestra! Harmony!"

70
00:04:17.371 --> 00:04:20.065
Matt repeated to himself at the next practice.

71
00:04:20.066 --> 00:04:22.534
Suddenly he saw the ball flying at Georgia.

72
00:04:22.535 --> 00:04:26.129
"Watch out!" he yelled, jumping in front of it.

73
00:04:26.130 --> 00:04:29.240
"Thanks, Matt," Georgia smiled.

74
00:04:29.241 --> 00:04:33.094
Matt decided to do his best and be a true member of the team.

75
00:04:33.095 --> 00:04:36.502
"Matt!" Victor called and passed him the ball.

76
00:04:36.503 --> 00:04:43.100
"Luke! Here!" Matt kicked the ball to Luke.

77
00:04:43.101 --> 00:04:48.196
From then on, Matt began to play much better. His team won every game.

78
00:04:48.197 --> 00:04:53.676
Matt and his team were going to the championship!

79
00:04:53.677 --> 00:04:56.704
Finally it was the day of the big game.

80
00:04:56.705 --> 00:05:00.548
"Don't look at the ball!" the coach said before the game.

81
00:05:00.549 --> 00:05:03.610
"Don't look at the goal. Look at your teammates.

82
00:05:03.611 --> 00:05:08.845
Remember! You are all champions whether we win or lose!"

83
00:05:08.846 --> 00:05:13.054
After the first half, the teams were tied at one to one.

84
00:05:13.055 --> 00:05:17.055
Suddenly Matt saw an opportunity to score near the end of the game.

85
00:05:17.056 --> 00:05:19.387
His throat felt dry and his mouth was heavy.

86
00:05:19.388 --> 00:05:21.982
But he knew his team was depending on him.

87
00:05:21.983 --> 00:05:31.071
"Luke! Over here!" he shouted loudly.

88
00:05:31.072 --> 00:05:36.053
Luke passed the ball, but a player from the other team tackled Matt and knocked him down.

89
00:05:36.054 --> 00:05:38.214
Matt's teammates crowded around him.

90
00:05:38.215 --> 00:05:41.635
"Matt! Are you all right?" Luke bent over him.

91
00:05:41.636 --> 00:05:46.557
"We got a penalty kick! This is our big chance, Matt!" encouraged Victor.

92
00:05:46.558 --> 00:05:52.608
Matt slowly got up. He had to take the penalty kick.

93
00:05:52.609 --> 00:05:57.333
Matt never felt so scared in his life. The championship depended on him.

94
00:05:57.334 --> 00:06:03.059
He remembered all of the coach's advice and decided he would try his best for his new friends.

95
00:06:03.060 --> 00:06:06.183
He kicked the ball as hard as he could past the goalkeeper.

96
00:06:06.184 --> 00:06:11.854
Matt's kick scored a goal. Matt's team was the new soccer champion!

97
00:06:11.855 --> 00:06:15.793
"We won! You did it, Matt!" shouted Ben.

98
00:06:15.794 --> 00:06:21.824
"No, we did it! All of us did it together!" Matt said.

99
00:06:21.825 --> 00:06:26.210
The coach was right. Everyone was a champion.
